# PROVENANCE — Kingfisher roster, pipe-delimited. One airframe per line.
# Columns: reg|type|msn|kf_from|kf_to|later_ids|state|place|note|id_conf|st_conf|src1|src2
#
# state:    active | stored | withdrawn | scrapped | written_off | preserved | unknown
# id_conf:  verified (2+ independent sources) | partial (1) | sketchy
# st_conf:  same scale, judged on CURRENT status evidence only
# kf_from/kf_to: Kingfisher operator era. Blank = not yet established. DO NOT GUESS.
# later_ids: post-Kingfisher registrations in order, separated by >
# Empty field = unknown. Empty is a valid, honest answer everywhere in this file.
#
# ALL rows carry status as_of 2026-08-25 (set by the converter, not per-row).
# Sources are from the citation-recovery pass and have NOT been individually
# re-opened by hand. Spot-check protocol is in antigravity-prompts-phase0b.md.

reg|type|msn|kf_from|kf_to|later_ids|state|place|note|id_conf|st_conf|src1|src2

